  | Scope | Command | When to use |
  |---|---|---|
{% for _kind in _kind_to_type %}
  | One {{ _kind }} | `sq {{ _kind_to_type[_kind] }} <n> {{ _kind }} <k> comment` | {{ _kind_notes.get(_kind, "Notes scoped to this sub-entity") }} |
{% endfor %}
