explicit `--status` to see them.{% if _priority.field %} Set importance with `--{{ _priority.field.code }} {{ _priority.values | join('|') }}`.{% endif +%}

Run `sq --help`, `sq <type> --help`, or `sq <type> <n> --help` for the full surface.

